Your sandbox issuer expires in 7 days

Acme Wallet Issuer stops being active on Tuesday, 1 December 2026, 14:05 UTC.
Renew it before then to keep it working.

Issuer:     Acme Wallet Issuer
Issuer ID:  6f1c2a9e-0b7d-4c1e-9a53-2f8d7e4b1c00
Expires:    Tuesday, 1 December 2026, 14:05 UTC

Renew the issuer: https://portal.example.com/issuers/6f1c2a9e-0b7d-4c1e-9a53-2f8d7e4b1c00

Once it has expired, renewing it brings it back only while the sandbox has
room for it. If you no longer need the issuer, you can ignore this email.

--
You get this email because you registered this issuer on the Status List
Portal, which sends reminders to your GitHub account's primary email. The
portal emails you only about your issuers.
